   "size": "m",
   "fill": "orange",
   "page": "review",
   "text": "Watch: what changes besides the look. Yes or no to each?\n\na · The set screen shows last time's reps for this set (\"Last 9\").\nb · Undo moves from the set screen to the rest and break screens.\nc · Today rows lose the round kind icons. The target weight sits on the right, with an arrow when it goes up or down today.\nd · A rest day has no Start workout button.\ne · End workout is one screen with three buttons, no scrolling.\nf · \"Back to list\" under All done is gone (Back is already there)."
  },
